                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "M7dsc",
                      "name": "Prose",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "layout": "vertical",
                      "gap": 18,
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "lslXt",
                          "name": "H2 为什么是画布",
                          "fill": "$text-primary",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "为什么是画布",
                          "lineHeight": 1.5,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-display",
                          "fontSize": 22,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "lQ2iF",
                          "name": "P",
                          "fill": "$text-primary",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "过去两年我一直在想一个问题：如果界面不再由人一格一格摆出来，而是由意图直接生长出来，那么工具应该长成什么样子。答案大概不是又一个属性面板，而是一块可以随时被推翻重来的画布。",
                          "lineHeight": 1.9,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                          "fontSize": 15,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "ASSAb",
                          "name": "P",
                          "fill": "$text-primary",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "画布的好处在于它天然容纳「未完成」。你可以把三个互相矛盾的方案并排放着，过两天再回来决定留下哪个。这种宽容度是表单式界面很难提供的。",
                          "lineHeight": 1.9,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                          "fontSize": 15,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "SGldd",
                          "name": "Quote",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "gap": 16,
                          "padding": [
                            4,
                            0
                          ],
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "rectangle",
                              "cornerRadius": 2,
                              "id": "sswT1",
                              "name": "Bar",
                              "fill": "$gold",
                              "width": 3,
                              "height": 28
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "krLpH",
                              "name": "Quote Text",
                              "fill": "$text-secondary",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "工具的上限不是它能做多少事，而是它允许你犯多少次错。",
                              "lineHeight": 1.8,
                              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                              "fontSize": 16,
                              "fontWeight": "normal",
                              "fontStyle": "italic"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "RWdwg",
                          "name": "H2 从图层到语义",
                          "fill": "$text-primary",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "从图层到语义",
                          "lineHeight": 1.5,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-display",
                          "fontSize": 22,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "r6C4AG",
                          "name": "P",
                          "fill": "$text-primary",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "传统设计文件里，一个按钮是「圆角矩形 + 居中文本」。而在语义化的画布里，它就是一个按钮：它知道自己有主次状态，知道被点击后应该给出反馈。渲染只是它的一种表现形式。",
                          "lineHeight": 1.9,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                          "fontSize": 15,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
